{"id":952588,"title":"12｜工具设计哲学：从 API 到 Agent-Native 的范式跃迁","content":"<p>欢迎大家来到工程篇的第二大模块——<strong>Agent 工具生态</strong>！</p>\n<p>在前面的课程中，我们完成了小红书爆款笔记生成项目的实战，主要是让 Agent 在“脑力”层面进行思考、规划和写作。但是，一个真正强大的 AI 应用，绝不能仅仅停留在“纸上谈兵”。如果说大模型是 Agent 的“大脑”，那么<strong>工具（Tools）就是 Agent 探索世界、改变外部状态的“手和脚”</strong>。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://static001.geekbang.org/resource/image/72/48/72068449f789dcc07c9164ac709c2f48.png?wh=2166x898\" alt=\"图片\"><br>\n有了工具，Agent 就可以去查询数据库、读取本地文件、操作浏览器、甚至调用企业内部的微服务，真正帮你完成有价值的闭环任务。今天这节课，我们将从底层的设计哲学出发，探讨如何为大模型打造真正好用、不出错的专属工具。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>一、 工具使用的底层逻辑：Native Function Calling vs ReAct</h2>\n<p>在让 Agent 使用工具之前，我们需要先理解它底层到底是怎么跑通的。目前业界主流的工具调用范式主要有两种：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://static001.geekbang.org/resource/image/55/64/5513b40272f30cdd83339ee2ce974364.png?wh=2202x992\" alt=\"图片\"></p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Native Function Calling（原生函数调用）</strong>：这是目前大部分先进大模型（如 GPT-4, Qwen-Max 等）在底层 API 原生支持的能力。你在请求大模型时，不仅传入 <code>Message List</code>，还会传入一个 <code>Tools List</code>（包含工具的名称、描述和参数 JSON Schema）。大模型在理解语义后，会直接在其底层输出特殊的标记，告诉框架：“我要停下来，请帮我调用某个工具，参数是 XXX”。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>ReAct 范式</strong>：我们在第 2 节课解剖 Agent 时详细讲过，基于 <code>Thought -&gt; Action -&gt; Action Input -&gt; Observation</code> 的文本推演循环。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":406670,"user_name":"极客酱酱","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2934665,"ip_address":"四川","ucode":"18CDC1DB754D58","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/2c/c7/89/16437396.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1775632864,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":151188,"content":"是的，录课的时候比较早","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1521002,"ctime":1775641392,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":406670,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":2,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101114301,"comment_content":"crewai 1.12后会通过crewai&#47;utilities&#47;string_utils.py中的sanitize_tool_name func对tool name进行标准化命名（(lowercase, a-z0-9_ only, max 64 chars)，所以在hook函数中过滤tool时要用sanitize后的方法名。\nfile_read_tool_name = sanitize_tool_name(FileReadTool().name)\nfile_write_tool_name = sanitize_tool_name(FileWriterTool().name)","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1521002,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/17/35/6a/7997de5a.jpg","nickname":"晓寒","note":"","ucode":"8BB0F59591B8CC","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":683383,"discussion_content":"是的，录课的时候比较早","content_length":33,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1775641392,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":1045646,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/f4/8e/081c530c.jpg","nickname":"树","note":"","ucode":"8080E671F84C46","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":686616,"discussion_content":"果然啊，我说怎么输出路径是失踪在项目根路径中呢。。。原来是这个问题。感谢！\n```python\n    from crewai.utilities.string_utils import sanitize_tool_name\n    file_read_tool_name = sanitize_tool_name(&#34;Read a file&#39;s content&#34;)\n    file_write_tool_name = sanitize_tool_name(&#34;File Writer Tool&#34;)\n    tools_list = [file_read_tool_name, file_write_tool_name]\n```","content_length":407,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1779769084,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"上海","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":407527,"user_name":"Geek_365e70","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3684340,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"1C158E2A9DB461","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1778595680,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":151765,"content":"不是交互形式，中间过程的推导在底层模型也是独立的运行机制，并不只是给人看才打出来，而是开了才会去推导","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1521002,"ctime":1779230504,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":407527,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101114301,"comment_content":"01：32工具使用那一页不是很明白，我理解直接反射跟思维链推理应该是llm交互的两种形式吧， 要么直接输出，要么一步步推导有中间过程。  工具调用是在系统提示词里面写使用场景和决策逻辑，llm接口里注册scame， 并不会受交互形式影响。  不知道我理解对不对。","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1521002,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/17/35/6a/7997de5a.jpg","nickname":"晓寒","note":"","ucode":"8BB0F59591B8CC","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":686287,"discussion_content":"不是交互形式，中间过程的推导在底层模型也是独立的运行机制，并不只是给人看才打出来，而是开了才会去推导","content_length":150,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1779230504,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":406931,"user_name":"🍉这个西瓜不太甜🍉","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":4417619,"ip_address":"四川","ucode":"0DD14D43779272","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/43/68/53/8966b6df.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1776436114,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":151337,"content":"那得看下你的系统和编辑工具的编码了，让ai帮你查一下","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1521002,"ctime":1776647271,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":406931,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101114301,"comment_content":"输出的CRONTAB.md中的中文是乱码，怎么解决？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":15210